  "stdout": "Omnigraph graph database CLI\n\nUsage: omnigraph [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>\n\nCommands:\n  query                      Execute a read query against a branch or snapshot [aliases: read]\n  mutate                     Execute a graph mutation query against a branch [aliases: change]\n  alias                      Invoke an operator alias\n  load                       Load data into a graph (local or remote)\n  branch                     Branch operations\n  snapshot                   Show graph snapshot\n  export                     Export a full graph snapshot as JSONL\n  blob                       Read one logical node or edge Blob cell\n  commit                     Commit history operations\n  changes                    Follow a graph's change feed\n  schema                     Schema planning operations\n  graphs                     Manage graphs on a multi-graph server\n  init                       Initialize a new graph from a schema\n  optimize                   Compact small Lance fragments in every backing dataset of the graph\n  rebuild-full-text-indexes  Rebuild all full-text indexes from one branch's current rows\n  repair                     Classify and explicitly repair graph-manifest/Lance-HEAD drift\n  cleanup                    Remove old Lance versions from every backing dataset of the graph (destructive)\n  lint                       Validate queries against a schema (offline) or repo (repo-backed)\n  queries                    Operate on the server-side stored-query registry (`queries:`)\n"
